      {
        "id": "takeaways-from-this-exercise",
        "text": [
          "Takeaways from this exercise",
          "We can call the process of:",
          "having a question,",
          "finding data to investigate that question,",
          "reaching a conclusion,",
          "and then thinking of a next step which starts everything over again",
          "the",
          "data science lifecycle",
          ".",
          "This lifecycle involves",
          "constructing and critiquing claims made using data",
          ": which is the main goal of our course!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "types-of-claims",
        "text": [
          "Types of Claims"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "course-goal",
        "text": [
          "Course Goal",
          "To learn to critique and construct",
          "claims made using data."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "section-7",
